cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or analysis package, please cite the archived release associated with the manuscript."
title: "chocho: reproducible analyses for butterfly host-plant redistribution and resource geography"
type: software
version: "1.0.0"
authors:
  - family-names: "ZHANG"
    given-names: "Ruiqi"
repository-code: "https://github.com/zuizui0223/chocho"
abstract: >-
  Reproducible code, frozen analysis receipts, and manuscript materials for
  analyses of how human redistribution of larval host plants changes butterfly
  resource geography, host contribution concentration, diet-breadth associations,
  occurrence overlap, and secondary climate filtering.
keywords:
  - butterfly
  - host plants
  - biotic redistribution
  - resource geography
  - diet breadth
  - biogeography
